# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here we demonstrate the functionalities to augment the pool of electronic\n"
"configurations obtained by the action of transition operators on each electronic\n"
"configuration.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini kami menunjukkan fungsi untuk menokok kumpulan konfigurasi elektronik\n"
"yang diperoleh melalui tindakan operator peralihan ke atas setiap konfigurasi\n"
"elektronik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We demonstrate how to add single-electron hops of the type:\n"
"$$\n"
"c^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} c_{q\\sigma} |\\textbf{x} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"for $p, q = 1, ..., N_\\textrm{orb}$ and $\\sigma \\in \\{ \\uparrow, \\downarrow\\}$,\n"
"and for all $|\\textbf{x} \\rangle$ in the batch of electronic configurations.\n"
"We start by generating a batch of random electronic configurations:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami menunjukkan cara menambah lompatan satu elektron berjenis:\n"
"$$\n"
"c^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} c_{q\\sigma} |\\textbf{x} \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"untuk $p, q = 1, ..., N_\\textrm{orb}$ dan $\\sigma \\in \\{ \\uparrow, \\downarrow\\}$,\n"
"dan untuk semua $|\\textbf{x} \\rangle$ dalam kelompok konfigurasi elektronik.\n"
"Kami bermula dengan menjana kelompok konfigurasi elektronik rawak:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The excitation operators are specified inside a numpy array whose length is\n"
"equal to the number of fermionic nodes (or qubits). Each element of the array\n"
"must be a string that can take values:\n"
msgstr ""
"Operator pengujaan ditentukan di dalam tatasusunan numpy yang panjangnya\n"
"sama dengan bilangan nod fermionik (atau qubit). Setiap elemen tatasusunan\n"
"mestilah rentetan yang boleh mempunyai nilai:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'I'``: Identity\n"
msgstr "``'I'``: Identity\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'+'``: Creation operator\n"
msgstr "``'+'``: Operator penciptaan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``'-'``: Annihilation operator\n"
msgstr "``'-'``: Operator pemusnahan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We generate all possible single-electron transitions (amongst same spin\n"
"species).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami menjana semua peralihan satu elektron yang mungkin (antara spesies spin\n"
"yang sama).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now we apply the transition operators to the configurations in ``bitstring_matrix``:\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kami menggunakan operator peralihan pada konfigurasi dalam ``bitstring_matrix``:\n"
